License notices for the bundled web UI build output (dist/)

This directory is the minified build output of the Aletheia review web UI,
generated with Vite from original demiourgoi sources. The chunks embed
code from the following MIT-licensed projects; their copyright and
permission notices are preserved here as the MIT license requires.

